{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to book an in-person or virtual sound bathing experience in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Practical options for individuals and groups.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1720; --card:#0b1220; --muted:#98a0b3; --accent:#8be0c2; --accent-2:#7ec0ff; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --radius:14px; --mono:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, "Roboto Mono", monospace; --sans:system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{
      margin:0; font-family:var(--sans); background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071021 0%,#081626 60%); color:#e6f2f8; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(126,192,255,0.03), transparent 15%), radial-gradient(circle at 90% 85%, rgba(139,224,194,0.02), transparent 20%);
      padding:32px;
    }
    .site{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:#042028}
    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px;font-size:15px}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent-2)}

    /* hero */
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:24px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:28px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card),rgba(255,255,255,0.02));padding:20px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.7);}
    .hero-left h2{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:22px}
    .hero-left p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px}

    /* pattern */
    .pattern-wrap{position:relative;height:120px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
    .pattern-svg{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.12}

    /* mood selector */
    .mood{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
    .mood .chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .chip{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent-2);cursor:pointer;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .chip.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(126,192,255,0.08), rgba(139,224,194,0.06));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:var(--accent)}

    /* method card */
    .method{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .method .icon{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(139,224,194,0.12),rgba(126,192,255,0.08));display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-2)}
    .method h3{margin:0 0 4px 0}
    .method p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    /* pricing comparator */
    .pricing{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:999px;padding:6px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .toggle button{background:transparent;color:var(--muted);border:0;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#042028}
    .price-visual{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .price{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:28px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* form */
    form{display:grid;gap:10px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:inherit}
    textarea{min-height:110px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#042028;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .muted-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    footer{margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:920px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .pattern-wrap{height:100px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden>SB</div>
        <div>
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <div class="muted-note">Practical sound events in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Gather</a>
        <a href="events.html">Events</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">Why we practice</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" aria-current="page">Reach</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="card hero-left">
          <h2>Contact & Bookings</h2>
          <p>Ask about group rhythms, workplace sound breaks, or one-off private baths. We'll reply with available windows and a clear next step.</p>

          <div class="mood card" style="padding:12px;">
            <label class="muted-note">How are you feeling right now?</label>
            <div class="chips" role="list">
              <button class="chip" data-mood="tension">Tight / tense</button>
              <button class="chip" data-mood="foggy">Foggy / spaced out</button>
              <button class="chip" data-mood="wound">On edge / wired</button>
              <button class="chip" data-mood="restless">Restless / busy</button>
            </div>

            <div class="method" id="methodCard" style="margin-top:8px">
              <div class="icon" id="methodIcon">♫</div>
              <div>
                <h3 id="methodName">Choose your state</h3>
                <p id="methodDesc" class="muted-note">Picking a mood tailors the suggested sound approach and the booking prompt.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px">
              <button id="moodCta" class="btn">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <div class="muted-note" id="moodHint">We’ll include the suggested method in your booking note.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px;padding:12px">
            <label class="muted-note">Pricing glance</label>
            <div class="pricing">
              <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
                <button id="monthlyBtn" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Monthly</button>
                <button id="packBtn" role="tab">Session Pack</button>
              </div>

              <div class="price-visual">
                <div>
                  <div class="price" id="priceNumber">$35</div>
                  <div class="small" id="priceLabel">per drop-in</div>
                </div>
                <div class="muted-note">Animated figures — slide the toggle to compare structures</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <aside class="card pattern-wrap">
          <svg class="pattern-svg" viewBox="0 0 600 200" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden>
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#8be0c2" stop-opacity="0.14" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#7ec0ff" stop-opacity="0.08" />
              </linearGradient>
              <pattern id="p1" width="30" height="30" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(24)">
                <rect width="30" height="30" fill="none" />
                <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1.4" fill="url(#g1)" />
                <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="1.4" fill="url(#g1)" />
              </pattern>
              <filter id="f1" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="140%">
                <feTurbulence baseFrequency="0.9" numOctaves="1" stitchTiles="stitch" result="t"/>
                <feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="t" scale="6" />
              </filter>
            </defs>
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" filter="url(#f1)" />
            <g opacity="0.9">
              <path d="M10 140 C120 0 230 260 340 120 C450 -20 560 160 590 80" stroke="rgba(139,224,194,0.16)" stroke-width="18" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <path d="M10 160 C120 40 230 280 340 140 C450 0 560 200 590 120" stroke="rgba(126,192,255,0.12)" stroke-width="10" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </g>
          </svg>

          <div style="position:relative;padding:16px;z-index:2">
            <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Reach out</h3>
            <p class="muted-note">Quick replies — expected within 48 hours. For urgent booking requests call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>.</p>

            <form id="contactForm" action="" onsubmit="return false;" style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" required placeholder="Full name">

              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com">

              <label for="message">Message</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us about the group, date windows, accessibility needs..."></textarea>

              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:8px">
                <div class="muted-note">Or write: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
                <div>
                  <button class="btn" id="sendBtn">Send request</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </form>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <strong class="muted-note">Important — health & safety</strong>
              <p class="muted-note" style="margin-top:6px">Sound baths are supportive but not a substitute for medical care. Contraindications include: pregnancy (1st trimester consult required), recent seizures, certain implanted electronic devices, and acute psychiatric crisis. If in doubt, consult your provider before booking. For detailed guidance, mention it in your message.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="card" style="margin-bottom:18px">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Quick links & next steps</h3>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="btn" href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn" href="events.html">See upcoming events</a>
          <a class="btn" href="pricing.html">Compare rates</a>
        </div>
        <p class="muted-note" style="margin-top:10px">If you'd like us to hold a space for an organization or community group, include expected headcount and a preferred date range in your message.</p>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="privacy.html" style="color:var(--muted)">Privacy</a></div>
        <div class="muted-note">Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Mood-to-Method
    const moodMap = {
      tension: {name: 'Calm-Down Bowl Flow', desc: 'A slow bowl sequence with breath cues to ease the jaw, neck, and shoulders.', icon: '♪'},
      foggy: {name: 'Clarity Tone Session', desc: 'Focused harmonic layers to anchor attention and gently recover clarity.', icon: '◎'},
      wound: {name: 'Grounding Gong Sequence', desc: 'Deep, low resonances to stabilize and demobilize over-activation.', icon: '❂'},
      restless: {name: 'Rhythm Breath Reset', desc: 'Short paced cycle combining breath-phase prompts and handpans.', icon: '⟐'}
    };

    const chips = document.querySelectorAll('.chip');
    const methodName = document.getElementById('methodName');
    const methodDesc = document.getElementById('methodDesc');
    const methodIcon = document.getElementById('methodIcon');
    const moodCta = document.getElementById('moodCta');

    chips.forEach(chip=>{
      chip.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        chips.forEach(c=>c.classList.remove('active'));
        chip.classList.add('active');
        const key = chip.dataset.mood;
        const m = moodMap[key];
        // morph visual
        methodIcon.textContent = m.icon;
        methodName.textContent = m.name;
        methodDesc.textContent = m.desc;
        // update CTA phrasing but keep placeholder for backend
        moodCta.textContent = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — ' + m.name;
        moodCta.setAttribute('data-method', m.name);
      })
    });

    moodCta.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      // on click, prefill a mailto or open booking with method
      const method = moodCta.getAttribute('data-method') || '';
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Booking request' + (method ? ' — ' + method : ''));
      const body = encodeURIComponent('Hi,\n\nI\'d like to enquire about booking: ' + (method || 'sound session') + '.\n\nPreferred dates:\n\nHeadcount / Notes:\n');
      window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
    });

    // Pricing Comparator with animated numbers
    const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('monthlyBtn');
    const packBtn = document.getElementById('packBtn');
    const priceNumber = document.getElementById('priceNumber');
    const priceLabel = document.getElementById('priceLabel');

    let current = {value:35, label:'per drop-in'}; // default
    let animFrame = null;

    function animatePrice(start, end, duration, onFrame, onComplete){
      const startTime = performance.now();
      cancelAnimationFrame(animFrame);
      function frame(now){
        const t = Math.min(1, (now - startTime)/duration);
        const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1-t,3);
        const val = start + (end - start)*eased;
        onFrame(val);
        if(t<1) animFrame = requestAnimationFrame(frame);
        else onComplete && onComplete();
      }
      animFrame = requestAnimationFrame(frame);
    }

    function setActive(button){
      [monthlyBtn,packBtn].forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
      button.classList.add('active');
      monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected', monthlyBtn===button);
      packBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected', packBtn===button);
    }

    monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      setActive(monthlyBtn);
      // Monthly plan: $35 drop-in, $120/month subscription (3+ events)
      const targetVal = 120; // show subscription price
      priceLabel.textContent = 'per month (membership)';
      animatePrice(current.value, targetVal, 500, val=>{
        priceNumber.textContent = '$' + Math.round(val);
      }, ()=>{ current.value = targetVal; current.label = priceLabel.textContent; });
    });

    packBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      setActive(packBtn);
      // Pack plan: 5-session pack costing $150 (effective $30/session)
      const targetVal = 150;
      priceLabel.textContent = '5-session pack (one payment)';
      animatePrice(current.value, targetVal, 500, val=>{
        priceNumber.textContent = '$' + Math.round(val);
      }, ()=>{ current.value = targetVal; current.label = priceLabel.textContent; });
    });

    // contact form small client validation + mailto fallback
    const contactForm = document.getElementById('contactForm');
    const sendBtn = document.getElementById('sendBtn');
    contactForm.addEventListener('submit', e=>e.preventDefault());
    sendBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const message = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      if(!name || !email){
        alert('Please provide your name and email.');
        return;
      }
      // if site had a backend we would post; fallback to mailto prefill
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Booking / enquiry from ' + name);
      const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: ' + name + '\nEmail: ' + email + '\n\n' + message);
      window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
    });

    // small accessibility: keyboard toggle for pricing
    monthlyBtn.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{ if(e.key==='Enter') monthlyBtn.click(); });
    packBtn.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{ if(e.key==='Enter') packBtn.click(); });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact.html + README for sound_bath site (clinic_modern layout)

What this bundle contains:
- contact.html — full contact / booking page with interactive micro-features and inline SVG pattern.

Placeholders left in the HTML (do not replace here):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Primary features implemented on contact.html:
1) Mood-to-Method selector
   - Four mood chips (Tight / Foggy / Wired / Restless).
   - Selecting a mood morphs the method card (icon, heading, description) and updates the CTA text to include the chosen method.
   - CTA opens the default mail client with a prefilled subject and body including the suggested method. The backend placeholder email remains {{EMAIL}}.

2) Pricing Comparator (monthly vs session pack)
   - Two-option toggle (Monthly / Session Pack).
   - Animated number transition using requestAnimationFrame with easing.
   - Label changes to reflect the selected pricing framing.

3) Contact form + mailto fallback
   - Lightweight client validation (name and email required).
   - Submits via mailto: to maintain zero-backend behavior; email target = {{EMAIL}}.

4) Health & safety note
   - Contraindications are listed as required by rules (pregnancy, seizures, implanted devices, acute psychiatric crisis) with a request to consult providers and to declare concerns when booking.

Design notes and constraints:
- No external assets or fonts are used; the page relies on system fonts.
- Visual texture is created inline with an SVG pattern and subtle gradients.
- Navigation uses a distinct label set: Gather, Events, Private, Rates, Why we practice, Reserve, Reach.
- CTA phrasing is intentionally varied; the mood CTA reads "{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — [method]" to keep the placeholder present and add context.
- The page is self-contained: all JS and CSS are inline.

Testing instructions:
- Open contact.html in a browser.
- Click mood chips to observe the method card morph and CTA text change.
- Click the mood CTA or the Send request button to trigger a mail client with prefilled subject/body. (If no mail client is configured, copy the produced mailto URL.)
- Toggle Monthly / Session Pack to watch animated price transitions.

Developer notes:
- The mailto approach preserves privacy and simplicity; replace with a POST endpoint if backend mailing is available.
- The pricing numbers are illustrative; update logic/data to reflect final pricing models.
- For accessibility, simple keyboard interactions are wired for the pricing toggle and regular form semantics are preserved.

Files generated in this chunk:
- contact.html
- README.md

Next chunk expectations (not included here):
- The events page must include a next-event module + calendar list.
- Unique SVG asset at assets/img/pattern.svg will be provided in a future chunk if required; this page includes an inline pattern to keep visuals consistent without external files."}
